---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Studio — Anthony Craythorn Sound Design" description="Brunswick based studio for vocal recording, production polish, mixing and mastering.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Brunswick studio</p>
        <h1>Studio</h1>
        <p class="lede">Brunswick based studio for mixing and vocal recording.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/contact">Inquire Now</a>
          <a class="button ghost" href="/listen">Listen to samples</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="portrait-card">
        <img src="/images/studio-hero.png" alt="Anthony's Brunswick recording studio" />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
        <h2>My Services</h2>
        <div class="service-list">
          <article class="service" id="vocal-recording">
            <h3>Vocal Recording</h3>
            <p>Capture your performance in a space designed for artists. My Brunswick studio offers a relaxed environment where you can focus on delivering your best take — whether that's intimate verses, powerful belt notes, or layered harmonies. I'll work with you to shape your performance, offering direction and production guidance to bring out what the song needs.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service" id="production-polish">
            <h3>Production Polish</h3>
            <p>Recorded in your bedroom or captured live, I can take whatever you've got and transform it into something release-ready. From removing background noise and fixing pitch issues to cleaning up room reverb and tightening timing, I'll polish your raw recordings into professional tracks without losing what made the performance special.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service" id="mixing">
            <h3>Mixing</h3>
            <p>Whether you're tracking an indie release or capturing a cast recording, I'll shape your raw tracks into something cohesive and compelling — balanced, dynamic, and true to your vision. We'll work together to find the sound that serves the music and connects with your audience.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service" id="mastering">
            <h3>Mastering</h3>
            <p>The final step that brings everything together. I'll ensure your music translates beautifully across all playback systems — from AirPods to festival sound systems, streaming platforms to vinyl — while preserving dynamics and emotional impact.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button dark" href="/contact">Get In Touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="image-tile">
        <img src="/images/studio-mic.png" alt="Studio microphone setup" />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
